    limitation: 'A bounded political and constitutional history, not a score for Brazil, Brazilians, the armed forces, the Workers’ Party, the PMDB, every constituent, social movement or later government. Constitutional design, civilian transition, racial and Indigenous inclusion, gender, land reform, labor, federalism, judicial review and lived social rights require separate evidence. Formal rights and pluralism do not prove equal access or outcomes.',
